Built by openprinthq-desktops (apps/crealityprint): Creality Print's Linux build on linuxserver.io's Selkies base,
restyled for OpenPrintHQ. The repository holds no copy of Creality Print or of the base image. The image built contains the
works below, each under its own licence, which the repository and the image keep.

linuxserver.io docker-baseimage-selkies
  https://github.com/linuxserver/docker-baseimage-selkies
  Copyright (C) linuxserver.io. GNU General Public License, version 3 (LICENSE).
  The image's base, its start-up scripts, its window manager settings (defaults/labwc.xml) and its web server
  set-up (etc/s6-overlay/s6-rc.d/init-nginx/run) are linuxserver.io's; common/restyle.py changes the last two
  as described in it. The repository's own files are offered under the same licence, GPL-3.0 (LICENSE).

Selkies
  https://github.com/selkies-project/selkies
  The web desktop and its dashboard (usr/share/selkies), Mozilla Public License 2.0 as published with it.
  The OpenPrintHQ dashboard is a copy of Selkies' own with one stylesheet added; Selkies' files are not changed.

Creality Print
  https://github.com/CrealityOfficial/CrealityPrint
  Copyright (C) Creality and the Creality Print authors (a fork of OrcaSlicer, itself of Bambu Studio and
  PrusaSlicer). GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (LICENSES/AGPL-3.0.txt). Its Linux build from the
  release at the version in apps/crealityprint/upstream.env, checked against the hash that release publishes;
  its source is that release's tag in the repository above. It is not changed.

Firefox
  From the xtradeb/apps archive, as linuxserver.io's own images install it. Mozilla Public License 2.0, used as
  the desktop's web browser.

Fonts
  Manrope, Sora and JetBrains Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (the licence files are in the image next to the
  fonts, usr/share/selkies/artisanhub-dashboard/ahi/fonts).
